@page "/"
@layout PublicLayout

<PageTitle>ConsuCare — Peer support for life with chronic illness</PageTitle>

<div class="land">
    <div class="nav">
        <a class="logo-inline" href="/">
            <span class="mark"><Icon Name="users" Size="15" /></span>ConsuCare
        </a>
        <div class="links">
            <a class="mut" href="/#features">Features</a>
            <a class="mut" href="/#how">How It Works</a>
            <a class="mut" href="/signup">Sign Up</a>
            <a href="/login"><span class="btn btn-out btn-sm">Log In</span></a>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="hero">
        <h1>New diagnosis.<br />You don't have to navigate it alone.</h1>
        <p>ConsuCare connects people newly diagnosed with chronic illness to peers who understand the day-to-day reality and are willing to share lived experience.</p>
        <div class="cta">
            <a href="/signup"><span class="btn btn-dark">Get Started</span></a>
            <a href="/#how"><span class="btn btn-out">Learn More</span></a>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="feat" id="features">
        <div class="card card-dark">
            <div class="icon"><Icon Name="users" Size="19" /></div>
            <h3>Find peer support</h3>
            <p>Discover supporters by condition and connect with someone who can listen and share their own experience.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card card-dark">
            <div class="icon"><Icon Name="chat" Size="19" /></div>
            <h3>Real-Time Chat</h3>
            <p>Continue your conversation in one place, at a pace that works for you.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card card-dark">
            <div class="icon"><Icon Name="flag" Size="19" /></div>
            <h3>Goal Tracking</h3>
            <p>Set small, personal wellbeing goals and recognize progress without pressure or comparison.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="how" id="how">
        <div class="inner">
            <h2>How It Works</h2>
            <div class="steps">
                <div class="step">
                    <div class="num">1</div>
                    <h4>Create your profile</h4>
                    <p>Join as a patient or supporter. Supporters choose whether to share health details in the directory.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="step">
                    <div class="num">2</div>
                    <h4>Find your match</h4>
                    <p>Browse approved peer-support profiles by condition, read about lived experience, and request a conversation.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="step">
                    <div class="num">3</div>
                    <h4>Grow together</h4>
                    <p>Share messages and set personal goals together. You decide what to discuss and what feels useful.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="testi">
        <h2>Peer support can start with a conversation</h2>
        <p class="mut">Illustrative demo stories, not real patient testimonials or medical guidance.</p>
        <div class="grid">
            <div class="quote">
                <p>"I wanted to talk to someone who understood what the first few weeks could feel like. It helped to be heard."</p>
                <div class="who">
                    <Avatar Name="Amara Osei" Size="sm" />
                    <div><b>Amara Osei</b><span>Demo patient profile</span></div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="quote">
                <p>"We compared notes about everyday routines. I left with ideas to consider and questions for my care team."</p>
                <div class="who">
                    <Avatar Name="David Kim" Size="sm" />
                    <div><b>David Kim</b><span>Demo patient profile</span></div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="quote">
                <p>"Everyone's experience is different, but having someone listen without judgment made a difference to me."</p>
                <div class="who">
                    <Avatar Name="Priya Sharma" Size="sm" />
                    <div><b>Priya Sharma</b><span>Demo patient profile</span></div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="foot">
        <div class="logo-inline inv">
            <span class="mark"><Icon Name="users" Size="15" /></span>ConsuCare
        </div>
        <div class="flinks">
            <a href="/#features">Features</a>
            <a href="/#how">How It Works</a>
            <a href="/signup">Join ConsuCare</a>
            <a href="/login">Sign in</a>
        </div>
        <div class="copy">ConsuCare is a peer-support community, not a substitute for professional medical advice, diagnosis, or treatment.</div>
    </div>
</div>
